WEBVTT

00:11.610 --> 00:14.200
It's been a while, Tsugumi.

00:17.200 --> 00:18.490
Minashi...

00:23.120 --> 00:24.920
Tsugumi?

00:24.920 --> 00:28.000
That's right. I'm Tsugumi.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.130
You remember me now, right, Akashi?

00:33.760 --> 00:38.680
How we used to play and nap together.

00:39.600 --> 00:42.060
And the promise we made to each other.

00:42.980 --> 00:44.480
Promise?

00:44.480 --> 00:45.650
What are you talking about?

00:46.230 --> 00:50.610
A dear promise that we made to each other.

00:51.070 --> 00:55.110
Tsugumi, we had all forgotten everything.

00:55.110 --> 00:57.120
Everything that happened while we were here.

00:58.240 --> 01:00.120
And about you too.

01:00.700 --> 01:05.040
We even forgot that we were the
ones who created the Lightless Realm.

01:08.580 --> 01:09.380
What?

01:26.020 --> 01:27.810
I'm Tsugumi.

01:27.810 --> 01:29.610
Sasame is my younger sister.

01:30.270 --> 01:34.570
The one who you're truly in
love with is none other than me.

01:46.710 --> 01:55.050
The ink on today's graffiti runs

01:55.050 --> 02:06.060
A bicycle that has been abandoned awaits someone's return

02:06.060 --> 02:17.030
When we realized, it was up for us to choose if our existence is a replica or not

02:17.030 --> 02:21.410
Where is our proof?

02:21.410 --> 02:26.500
It's mankinds nature to come together

02:26.500 --> 02:31.540
Our love and bonds are things we can trust

02:31.540 --> 02:36.340
My sins are to be doubted

02:36.340 --> 02:42.680
The light I saw when you first held out your right hand

02:46.060 --> 02:51.520
We really are

03:00.030 --> 03:02.240
The Dark Metal

03:06.580 --> 03:10.830
The Lightless Realm
is steadily expanding.

03:07.450 --> 03:12.500
Episode 16
Promised Together

03:10.830 --> 03:13.920
You could say it's in an active state now.

03:13.920 --> 03:17.170
Enough of that. What about the three MA-Vesses?

03:17.170 --> 03:18.090
Are they all right?

03:18.630 --> 03:23.850
The fact that you said the Corpse isn't dead yet has become a real problem.

03:23.850 --> 03:26.100
A problem?

03:26.100 --> 03:27.310
I don't know what you mean.

03:27.310 --> 03:30.770
They think it's a lie to avoid research budgets cuts.

03:30.770 --> 03:36.520
I can't further report that we've lost all
three MA-Vesses when there's no Corpse!

03:36.520 --> 03:41.030
Do you have to be an idiot to
be a member of that committee?

03:42.030 --> 03:43.990
I hope they get divine retribution.

03:43.990 --> 03:46.660
You've always been like this—

03:47.660 --> 03:48.330
What's that?

03:48.870 --> 03:50.580
I wonder what it is.

03:57.250 --> 04:00.470
Admonitions at IX headquarters... But how?

04:00.470 --> 04:04.050
As I said before, it's in an active state now.

04:04.050 --> 04:05.340
I'm sure it's affecting them.

04:07.310 --> 04:08.640
Admonitions!

04:08.640 --> 04:09.390
How many?

04:09.390 --> 04:11.060
HQ, we're awaiting orders!

04:11.060 --> 04:13.310
Please scramble the Vesses!

04:13.310 --> 04:15.150
They're going to attack!

04:15.150 --> 04:15.770
Fall back!

04:24.280 --> 04:25.320
Help me!

04:28.700 --> 04:31.830
Admonitions have been sighted at IX's HQ and Kukunochi Academy!

04:33.080 --> 04:35.040
Apparently three of them appeared simultaneously.

04:36.250 --> 04:38.750
And with no MA-Vesses...

04:38.750 --> 04:39.630
Iwato!

04:39.630 --> 04:40.460
Raika!

04:40.460 --> 04:41.880
Are you serious?

04:41.880 --> 04:43.380
Let's go, Iwato!

04:43.380 --> 04:43.930
Sure.

04:48.680 --> 04:50.850
Will we be all right by ourselves?

04:50.850 --> 04:55.730
I don't know, but we have to protect the place they'll be coming back to.

04:56.770 --> 04:57.810
You're right.

05:02.030 --> 05:04.400
"We created the Lightless Realm."

05:05.240 --> 05:07.030
What did you mean by that?

05:08.490 --> 05:10.450
I'll show you.

05:30.970 --> 05:32.560
This is...

05:32.560 --> 05:34.600
Yomijima from ten years ago.

05:34.600 --> 05:35.770
Yomijima?

05:36.270 --> 05:38.600
The island that we were born on.

05:48.320 --> 05:50.280
Sasame, are you all right?

05:50.280 --> 05:51.780
Tsugumi-chan, I'm sorry.

05:51.780 --> 05:55.580
No matter where they hide,
find them and leave no one alive.

05:55.580 --> 05:56.410
Got that?

05:57.790 --> 05:58.290
Who's that?

06:03.670 --> 06:05.720
Everyone, the priestesses...

06:05.720 --> 06:07.550
The priestesses!

06:07.550 --> 06:09.140
It's so good to see that you're safe.

06:09.140 --> 06:09.930
Thank goodness.

06:10.430 --> 06:13.180
In the end, only a few of us were able to escape.

06:13.180 --> 06:15.890
I can't forgive those IX guys!

06:16.890 --> 06:17.520
Our priestesses...

06:19.020 --> 06:21.360
Take revenge for this atrocity.

06:20.230 --> 06:28.740
Toss a coconut onto the black of Corpses...

06:21.940 --> 06:25.820
It's time to borrow the deity's power from within the Lightless Stone.

06:29.030 --> 06:33.990
Suspicions of Charon and Garon...

06:34.580 --> 06:42.420
One, meddling in affairs of crying children...

06:39.210 --> 06:41.670
Bring the carapace of the Corpse.

06:43.710 --> 06:50.720
Two, burn the bones of crying children...

06:46.210 --> 06:52.970
Revive the Corpse and bring
Admonitions down on those sinners.

06:52.970 --> 06:57.980
Atop the carcass is a crying child...

06:59.060 --> 07:03.560
Quiet, just be quiet, suspicious of the Corpses...

07:03.560 --> 07:09.570
Scattered into ashes, here, Garon...

07:15.120 --> 07:18.750
Even though we had gotten orders to burn everything down to the ground,

07:18.750 --> 07:21.250
there was no real reason to do so.

07:21.250 --> 07:24.500
We needed to eradicate all persons and objects.

07:24.500 --> 07:27.130
Not all persons were eliminated, though.

07:27.130 --> 07:28.260
What?

07:29.090 --> 07:33.010
They're among the children that were spirited away, you know.

07:33.010 --> 07:34.350
Impossible!

07:51.280 --> 07:52.530
Stop this at once!

07:53.740 --> 07:56.620
We couldn't do anything about it!

07:56.620 --> 07:58.160
Know that I too—

08:12.470 --> 08:14.510
Such poor taste.

08:29.480 --> 08:30.570
Corpse!

08:33.320 --> 08:34.820
This is Tokyo?

08:34.820 --> 08:38.030
It feels like there's steel all over.

08:39.450 --> 08:41.040
Children?

08:41.040 --> 08:43.290
How'd you get in?

08:43.290 --> 08:46.750
Um, which way is the place called Tokyo?

08:46.750 --> 08:49.420
You have to speak verbally to these people.

08:49.420 --> 08:50.170
Oh, right.

08:53.880 --> 08:55.130
What are your names?

08:55.840 --> 08:58.390
Aren't your fathers and mothers with...

08:58.390 --> 09:00.770
Wh-What in the world are you?

09:01.810 --> 09:03.100
Tsugumi-chan?

09:03.100 --> 09:03.980
Corpse!

09:07.650 --> 09:08.440
Run!

09:09.730 --> 09:10.980
Let's go!

09:10.980 --> 09:12.190
Wait!

09:12.190 --> 09:13.400
Hold it!

09:13.400 --> 09:16.110
PEDESTRIANS/BICYCLES ONLY

09:21.410 --> 09:23.830
It's scary... I want to go back to the island.

09:24.250 --> 09:27.080
No, we can't. We have to get revenge.

09:27.080 --> 09:28.420
That's right.

09:28.420 --> 09:29.790
It's all because of them.

09:33.630 --> 09:36.630
We're priestesses, so we have to hang on.

09:36.630 --> 09:37.510
Yeah...

09:39.600 --> 09:40.600
I'm terribly sorry!

09:40.600 --> 09:42.560
You don't sound sincere enough!

09:43.810 --> 09:48.900
Scary... I'm scared... I'm so scared!

09:48.900 --> 09:48.940
IX Ability Development

09:48.900 --> 09:48.940
IX Education

09:51.270 --> 09:52.440
Found it!

10:20.680 --> 10:22.300
What'll happen now?

10:22.300 --> 10:27.600
When the deity's power wanes, we take it back to the island.

10:27.600 --> 10:29.770
I wonder if everyone's okay...

10:30.350 --> 10:31.980
Hey, I hear voices coming from over here.

10:31.980 --> 10:32.770
Me too.

10:35.320 --> 10:36.490
This isn't good!

10:40.320 --> 10:43.700
If they see the Corpse, I'll have to kill them.

10:43.700 --> 10:45.620
But they're children...

10:45.620 --> 10:47.910
No, I'll still have to.

10:47.910 --> 10:49.580
Because those are the rules.

10:49.580 --> 10:50.960
What's that?

10:51.420 --> 10:52.330
Huh?

10:52.330 --> 10:54.960
Oh, this?

10:54.960 --> 10:55.670
Yup.

11:11.650 --> 11:12.860
Wanna try?

11:14.320 --> 11:16.360
I can do it too!

11:16.360 --> 11:18.030
My turn next!

11:18.030 --> 11:20.030
Hey, can you do an "Around the World"?

11:22.660 --> 11:23.910
What was that for?

11:23.910 --> 11:25.240
It's mine now!

11:25.240 --> 11:27.160
Hey, come on!

11:27.160 --> 11:30.040
I was gonna do an Around the World!

11:29.040 --> 11:31.080
What have I been doing?

11:54.610 --> 11:56.440
All Vesses are to retreat!

11:57.940 --> 12:00.610
Rush the Admonition attack pattern analysis!

12:04.700 --> 12:06.330
It's Gargouille's Vesses!

12:07.200 --> 12:09.040
Ready the mortars! We'll assist!

12:09.580 --> 12:11.120
Got it, Iwato?

12:11.120 --> 12:12.580
Yeah, I got it!

12:26.800 --> 12:28.510
Over here!

12:34.770 --> 12:36.730
She's pretty good.

12:36.730 --> 12:39.190
Iwato, one got away.

12:39.190 --> 12:39.900
Let's chase it!

12:39.900 --> 12:42.280
Sure, I'll follow you!

12:42.780 --> 12:45.740
Nineteen, twenty...

12:45.740 --> 12:47.570
Ready or not?

12:47.570 --> 12:49.240
Ready!

12:49.240 --> 12:51.540
All right, I'm gonna find you all!

12:51.540 --> 12:53.370
Do you remember now, Akashi?

12:53.370 --> 12:55.420
Yeah, it's true...

12:55.420 --> 12:57.000
We really were together.

12:56.250 --> 12:57.540
I found Mahmu-chan!

12:58.340 --> 13:00.300
We were all good friends.

13:01.550 --> 13:03.510
There wasn't a single adult around.

13:04.340 --> 13:06.800
No one scolded us no matter what we did.

13:06.800 --> 13:08.720
It was like one big dream.

13:09.470 --> 13:14.600
We forgot all about being separated from our parents and started playing together.

13:15.770 --> 13:22.990
To the three of us, everything was brand new
because we had no one else to play with before.

13:22.990 --> 13:27.570
Everything was full of wonder and really fun.

13:28.990 --> 13:33.700
But we had to end it all someday.

13:34.790 --> 13:36.170
We knew we had to.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.650
What's wrong?

14:06.820 --> 14:08.160
Does it hurt somewhere?

14:08.160 --> 14:09.740
It's not that.

14:09.740 --> 14:10.450
I'm sorry...

14:23.380 --> 14:24.920
Tsugumi-chan...

14:24.920 --> 14:26.300
Are you okay?

14:26.300 --> 14:28.590
What is it? Tell us.

14:29.090 --> 14:31.510
I'm sorry.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.970
It's nothing...

14:37.850 --> 14:39.100
It's just...

14:39.560 --> 14:45.150
When I thought that I had to say
good-bye to everyone someday...

14:47.360 --> 14:48.950
That's right...

14:49.570 --> 14:51.320
I remember now.

14:51.780 --> 14:53.780
Back then, I said...

14:56.750 --> 14:57.660
It's all right.

15:00.870 --> 15:02.250
I'll be with you.

15:04.710 --> 15:07.010
I'll always be with you.

15:07.010 --> 15:08.170
Really?

15:08.670 --> 15:11.140
I wanted to be like Aoshi.

15:11.590 --> 15:12.760
I promise.

15:14.220 --> 15:15.560
Akashi...

15:17.600 --> 15:19.020
Akashi-kun...

15:40.370 --> 15:45.840
Ten, eleven, twelve...

15:45.840 --> 15:47.300
Over here.

15:49.630 --> 15:51.050
What is it this time?

15:51.050 --> 15:53.680
We failed earlier, so...

15:54.340 --> 15:57.760
How about we go in through the roof?

15:57.760 --> 15:59.140
Ah, that's good idea!

15:59.140 --> 16:01.600
No! If we stray from the Arbornine, then...

16:01.600 --> 16:02.190
Arbornine?

16:02.190 --> 16:03.400
What's that?

16:03.400 --> 16:05.730
We'll be just fine if it's for a bit!

16:05.730 --> 16:07.730
But Tsugumi-chan...

16:07.730 --> 16:08.440
Ow.

16:08.980 --> 16:11.650
If we're told we shouldn't, then we should listen.

16:11.650 --> 16:12.700
Come on!

16:12.990 --> 16:15.030
There's no helping the rules.

16:15.030 --> 16:16.910
Gimme that!

16:16.910 --> 16:17.620
Raika, pass!

16:17.620 --> 16:18.990
Right!

16:18.990 --> 16:20.660
Ow! Me again?

16:20.660 --> 16:23.420
Ow, ow, ow!

16:25.830 --> 16:26.500
Heito?

16:27.590 --> 16:28.460
That was from outside.

16:32.670 --> 16:33.590
Heito!

16:34.050 --> 16:36.140
What in the world happened?

16:38.220 --> 16:39.180
This is...

16:41.480 --> 16:44.730
What happened to the city?

16:44.730 --> 16:45.770
I'm scared.

16:51.900 --> 16:54.860
Thirty-three, thirty-four...

17:01.700 --> 17:03.580
What is this?

17:03.580 --> 17:05.000
Where's my home?

17:05.000 --> 17:06.040
Momma!

17:06.040 --> 17:08.210
The darkness is here...

17:08.670 --> 17:12.420
All of you, calm down!
We'll be fine if we go back inside.

17:18.640 --> 17:21.100
Forty-two, forty-three...

17:22.810 --> 17:23.850
Wait, everyone!

17:23.850 --> 17:24.940
What do we do?

17:24.940 --> 17:27.150
We can't leave them alone.

17:27.150 --> 17:28.940
For now, get Arbornine's fruit to them.

17:28.940 --> 17:29.770
Okay.

17:44.710 --> 17:45.830
Momma!

17:45.830 --> 17:46.790
Momma, where are you?

17:56.430 --> 17:59.340
Where did you all go?

17:59.340 --> 18:01.260
I give up now.

18:01.260 --> 18:02.560
Come on out.

18:03.600 --> 18:05.140
Akashi,

18:05.140 --> 18:06.690
Sasame,

18:06.690 --> 18:07.850
Minashi...

18:09.810 --> 18:10.940
They're all gone.

18:12.650 --> 18:14.900
Where are you all?

18:37.050 --> 18:38.550
You did, right?

18:39.760 --> 18:43.260
You promised that you'd be together with me.

18:44.010 --> 18:47.390
Hey, where did you go?

18:49.390 --> 18:51.270
Hey!

18:51.270 --> 18:54.020
Where is everyone?

18:54.610 --> 18:56.530
Where are you all?

18:58.740 --> 19:01.370
Over here!

19:01.370 --> 19:03.450
I'm right over here!

19:05.200 --> 19:06.910
That's right.

19:06.910 --> 19:08.710
This is the truth.

19:09.160 --> 19:12.040
The truth behind the sin you all committed.

19:13.000 --> 19:15.670
All of you left me behind

19:16.670 --> 19:18.760
and betrayed me.

19:20.340 --> 19:23.260
All of you are children of sin.

19:24.010 --> 19:25.930
Everything is all your fault.

19:37.610 --> 19:41.110
I wonder if you can call this the devil's luck.

19:46.990 --> 19:50.870
You guys sure are persistent.

19:54.500 --> 19:55.880
Raika, I found it!

19:59.920 --> 20:01.050
Natsuiri!

20:01.050 --> 20:02.880
That bastard...

20:02.880 --> 20:05.800
We don't need to save bastards like him.

20:07.720 --> 20:08.890
Raika!

20:11.440 --> 20:13.900
Thank you, Kasumi-kun.

20:13.900 --> 20:15.940
You truly are a good girl.

20:15.940 --> 20:16.690
Shut up!

20:16.690 --> 20:17.730
Move it!

20:17.730 --> 20:19.900
I'll be taking my leave then.

20:19.900 --> 20:21.240
Raika...

20:21.860 --> 20:22.820
Dammit!

20:25.280 --> 20:26.030
Iwato.

20:26.030 --> 20:27.450
Suzaki-san.

20:27.450 --> 20:28.490
Use this.

20:28.490 --> 20:30.370
It's a magnetic bomb.

20:30.370 --> 20:32.210
It has the highest destructive power.

20:32.210 --> 20:33.710
You think you can pull it off?

20:34.170 --> 20:36.840
This is no time to ponder if I can or not!

20:38.040 --> 20:39.380
I also...

20:40.510 --> 20:41.630
Don't come here, Iwato!

20:49.430 --> 20:50.390
Dammit!

20:52.180 --> 20:53.140
Iwato!

21:03.900 --> 21:04.860
Ow...

21:05.570 --> 21:07.320
This is so uncool.

21:27.220 --> 21:30.430
Raika, you really are amazing...

21:32.140 --> 21:33.560
Iwato!

21:35.060 --> 21:36.560
No! Get back, Raika!

21:36.560 --> 21:38.900
There are still enemies about!

21:40.360 --> 21:41.730
Iwato...

21:46.700 --> 21:47.450
Yo.

21:48.910 --> 21:51.370
You're hurt...

21:51.370 --> 21:54.000
Damn, you saw me being uncool.

21:54.540 --> 21:56.620
D-Dammit.

21:56.620 --> 21:57.460
Raika?

21:58.120 --> 22:01.420
If only I could pilot a MA-Vess...

22:02.210 --> 22:03.630
A MA-Vess, huh?

22:04.920 --> 22:06.550
That's not it!

22:07.630 --> 22:09.970
I didn't mean it like that, Iwato!

22:09.970 --> 22:11.890
I can't allow something like that!

22:11.890 --> 22:12.680
Raika?

22:12.680 --> 22:17.190
If you were to become a LIM, I wouldn't be able to touch you like this anymore.

22:17.770 --> 22:19.520
I can't take that.

22:19.520 --> 22:20.520
Raika...

22:20.520 --> 22:22.940
I don't want that, Iwato! Don't leave me alone.

22:22.940 --> 22:25.400
Be with me. Be with me forever!

22:26.650 --> 22:28.410
Raika, I...

22:31.910 --> 22:33.080
I...

22:56.430 --> 23:00.480
You lose your mind, you crash; a nervous breakdown

23:00.480 --> 23:05.230
You feel an urge inside, you crush; there's no escape now

23:05.230 --> 23:10.110
You try to change your life, you jump another let down

23:10.110 --> 23:12.700
But then you hear a voice inside

23:12.700 --> 23:15.990
You gotta open up your vision and see the life bestowed on you

23:15.990 --> 23:18.580
Blinded by reality

23:18.580 --> 23:20.750
Broken ideology

23:20.750 --> 23:23.290
Heart in captivity

23:23.290 --> 23:25.630
Hold on, exceeding the borders within

23:25.630 --> 23:28.130
Seize your capability

23:28.130 --> 23:30.510
Endless possibility

23:30.510 --> 23:32.840
Find your individuality

23:32.930 --> 23:35.060
Take pride; let the chase begin

23:35.060 --> 23:37.720
Don't tell me what direction you think I should take

23:37.720 --> 23:39.520
I know now to find the way

23:39.520 --> 23:42.520
Don’t tell me that this sable is for my own sake

23:42.520 --> 23:44.060
Here's what I’ve got to say

23:44.060 --> 23:47.320
Don't tell me to believe the decisions you make

23:47.320 --> 23:49.530
Facing a new day

23:49.530 --> 23:51.530
So open up your blinded eyes

23:51.530 --> 23:54.530
Stop living a lie and start living your life

23:54.530 --> 23:56.870
My way or no way

23:56.870 --> 23:59.330
Today you’re falling away

23:59.330 --> 24:01.670
My way or no way

24:01.670 --> 24:04.960
Today I’m breaking away

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Episode 17

24:05.000 --> 24:10.010
Light of the Lightless
